{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "interview-agent_trace-0-3fd8029d079c", "source_type": "interview", "source_path": "data/raw/interview/agent_trace.md", "title": "agent_trace", "text": "# Agent Trace 面试笔记\n\n一次 Query 对应一条请求级 Trace，记录 routing、retrieval、context、generation、validation 和 total latency。错误请求也应尽可能保存已经完成的阶段。\n\nTrace 的目标是定位失败发生在哪一层、使用了什么配置以及修改后是否改善，而不是无边界地保存所有隐私数据。", "metadata": {"source_type": "interview", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "agent_trace.md", "char_count": 185}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "interview-citation_validation-0-bb7037fefc1e", "source_type": "interview", "source_path": "data/raw/interview/citation_validation.md", "title": "citation_validation", "text": "# Citation Validator 面试笔记\n\n模型返回的 cited chunk ids 是不可信输入。Validator 要检查 ID 是否存在于本轮 Context、是否重复，以及 sufficient 与引用是否为空的组合是否一致。\n\nCitation Validity 只证明引用 ID 合法，不证明回答结论得到证据的语义支持。后者需要人工核验或独立 Evidence Checker。", "metadata": {"source_type": "interview", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "citation_validation.md", "char_count": 201}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "interview-context_budget-0-dcdda70d52e0", "source_type": "interview", "source_path": "data/raw/interview/context_budget.md", "title": "context_budget", "text": "# Context Budget 面试笔记\n\nContext Builder 按检索 rank 选择完整 Chunk 前缀，预算包含证据 header、正文和分隔符。下一个完整 Chunk 放不下时停止，不从中间截断。\n\n字符预算实现简单且不绑定模型，但字符和 Token 不是一一对应。接入具体模型后应使用 tokenizer 计算完整 Prompt 的 Token 预算。", "metadata": {"source_type": "interview", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "context_budget.md", "char_count": 188}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "interview-rag_notes-0-8c5fd275dc69", "source_type": "interview", "source_path": "data/raw/interview/rag_notes.md", "title": "rag_notes", "text": "# RAG 面试笔记\n\n## 常见问题\n\n1. RAG 为什么需要 chunk 切分？\n2. 如何评估检索质量？\n3. 为什么回答里要带 citation（引用）？\n4. rerank（重排序）和普通召回有什么区别？\n\n## 回答要点\n\n1. chunk 是 RAG 中最小的证据单元，切得太大容易引入噪声，切得太小可能丢失上下文。\n2. Recall@k 用来衡量相关证据是否出现在前 k 个召回结果中。\n3. citation 可以把回答和原始证据对应起来，方便排查幻觉和引用错误。\n4. rerank 通常在初步召回之后进行，用更细的相关性判断重新排序候选证据。", "metadata": {"source_type": "interview", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "rag_notes.md", "char_count": 284}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "interview-retrieval_metrics-0-a4e3b1614eba", "source_type": "interview", "source_path": "data/raw/interview/retrieval_metrics.md", "title": "retrieval_metrics", "text": "# 检索指标面试笔记\n\nRecall@k 衡量前 k 个检索结果覆盖了多少人工标注的相关证据。MRR 只关注第一条相关证据的位置，相关证据越靠前，倒数排名越高。\n\n评测时要固定语料、Query、切分参数和 top-k。检索指标只能说明证据召回情况，不能直接等同于最终答案准确率。", "metadata": {"source_type": "interview", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "retrieval_metrics.md", "char_count": 139}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "interview-router_design-0-63b24daf1e5d", "source_type": "interview", "source_path": "data/raw/interview/router_design.md", "title": "router_design", "text": "# Router 设计面试笔记\n\n规则 Router 根据 Query 中的关键词预测 intent，并将 intent 映射到优先知识源。它的优点是行为可解释、测试简单，缺点是同义表达和多意图问题容易误判。\n\nRouter Accuracy 应独立计算，不能用全库检索碰巧找到答案来掩盖路由错误。", "metadata": {"source_type": "interview", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "router_design.md", "char_count": 149}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "jd-ai_platform_intern-0-a2cb7a9f6411", "source_type": "jd", "source_path": "data/raw/jd/ai_platform_intern.md", "title": "ai_platform_intern", "text": "# AI 平台研发实习生\n\n## 岗位职责\n\n参与模型服务接口、任务配置和运行日志模块开发，协助建设请求追踪、错误归类与性能监控能力。\n\n## 岗位要求\n\n熟悉 Python Web 开发，了解 FastAPI、HTTP、Docker 和 Linux；理解模型调用超时、重试、限流和密钥管理等基础工程问题。", "metadata": {"source_type": "jd", "job_id": "", "company": "示例平台公司", "job_title": "AI 平台研发实习生", "city": "杭州", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "2026-07-29", "last_seen_at": "2026-07-29", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 1, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "ai_platform_intern.md", "char_count": 153}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "jd-backend_intern-0-a1da3e9ac6ca", "source_type": "jd", "source_path": "data/raw/jd/backend_intern.md", "title": "backend_intern", "text": "# 大模型应用研发实习生\n\n## 岗位职责\n\n1. 参与企业知识库问答、RAG、Agent 工具调用等大模型应用开发。\n2. 负责文档解析、向量检索、Prompt 优化和回答质量评测。\n3. 协助建设大模型应用的日志分析、效果评测和失败案例归因流程。\n\n## 岗位要求\n\n1. 熟悉 Python，了解 FastAPI、Git、Linux 基础使用。\n2. 了解 RAG、embedding、向量数据库、rerank、Agent 工具调用等概念。\n3. 有大模型应用、智能客服、知识库问答或模型评测相关项目经验优先。\n4. 每周可实习 4 天以上，连续实习 3 个月以上。", "metadata": {"source_type": "jd", "job_id": "", "company": "示例公司", "job_title": "大模型应用研发实习生", "city": "广州", "source_platform": "manual", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "2026-06-13", "last_seen_at": "2026-06-13", "status": "active", "version": 1, "source_priority": 3, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "backend_intern.md", "char_count": 286}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "jd-data_engineer_intern-0-5c51b85be1d3", "source_type": "jd", "source_path": "data/raw/jd/data_engineer_intern.md", "title": "data_engineer_intern", "text": "# 数据工程实习生\n\n## 岗位职责\n\n参与离线数据清洗、任务调度和数据质量检查，维护 Python 数据处理脚本，协助定位缺失值、重复记录和字段格式异常。\n\n## 岗位要求\n\n熟悉 Python 与 SQL，了解 Linux、Git 和基础数据库知识；能够编写单元测试并记录数据处理失败原因。每周至少实习四天。", "metadata": {"source_type": "jd", "job_id": "", "company": "示例数据公司", "job_title": "数据工程实习生", "city": "深圳", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "2026-07-29", "last_seen_at": "2026-07-29", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 1, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "data_engineer_intern.md", "char_count": 156}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "jd-llm_evaluation_intern-0-4d8bd07a36b0", "source_type": "jd", "source_path": "data/raw/jd/llm_evaluation_intern.md", "title": "llm_evaluation_intern", "text": "# 大模型评测实习生\n\n## 岗位职责\n\n建设问答任务评测集，维护评测脚本和失败样例；统计准确率、召回率、拒答率与延迟，协助分析模型输出格式错误和无依据回答。\n\n## 岗位要求\n\n熟悉 Python，理解基本统计指标和 RAG 流程；有数据标注、模型评测、Prompt 实验或自动化测试经验优先。", "metadata": {"source_type": "jd", "job_id": "", "company": "示例智能公司", "job_title": "大模型评测实习生", "city": "上海", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "2026-07-29", "last_seen_at": "2026-07-29", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 1, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "llm_evaluation_intern.md", "char_count": 148}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "jd-python_backend_intern-0-599054e56ed8", "source_type": "jd", "source_path": "data/raw/jd/python_backend_intern.md", "title": "python_backend_intern", "text": "# Python 后端研发实习生\n\n## 岗位职责\n\n参与后端接口、数据校验和日志模块开发，编写单元测试并协助排查线上问题。\n\n## 岗位要求\n\n熟悉 Python 基础语法和常用数据结构，了解 REST API、关系型数据库、Git 与 Linux；重视代码可读性和异常处理。", "metadata": {"source_type": "jd", "job_id": "", "company": "示例软件公司", "job_title": "Python 后端研发实习生", "city": "广州", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "2026-07-29", "last_seen_at": "2026-07-29", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 1, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "python_backend_intern.md", "char_count": 139}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "jd-search_algorithm_intern-0-3717dbcae501", "source_type": "jd", "source_path": "data/raw/jd/search_algorithm_intern.md", "title": "search_algorithm_intern", "text": "# 搜索算法实习生\n\n## 岗位职责\n\n参与文本检索、召回排序和离线效果分析，构建查询样例并比较不同检索策略。\n\n## 岗位要求\n\n熟悉 Python，了解信息检索、向量表示、相似度计算和排序指标；有 BM25、embedding、向量索引或 rerank 实践经验优先。", "metadata": {"source_type": "jd", "job_id": "", "company": "示例搜索公司", "job_title": "搜索算法实习生", "city": "北京", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "2026-07-29", "last_seen_at": "2026-07-29", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 1, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "search_algorithm_intern.md", "char_count": 136}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "project_logs-day1_log-0-871483366c37", "source_type": "project_logs", "source_path": "data/raw/project_logs/day1_log.md", "title": "day1_log", "text": "# 项目日志 Day 1\n\n## 今日目标\n\n完成项目骨架和文档，不急着实现复杂业务代码。\n\n## 重要决策\n\n1. 第一版先用原生 Python 实现核心 RAG 流程，不提前引入 LangGraph 或 LlamaIndex。\n2. 每个模块都要保持足够小，方便在实习面试中讲清楚输入、输出和失败排查方式。\n3. 失败样例不能只停留在口头复盘，后续要沉淀为 regression test（回归测试）。\n\n## 当前限制\n\n1. 还没有实现检索和评测。\n2. 样本数据只用于开发和测试，不代表真实岗位数据。", "metadata": {"source_type": "project_logs", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_repository", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "day1_log.md", "char_count": 255}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "project_logs-evaluation_plan-0-4dffe51bc130", "source_type": "project_logs", "source_path": "data/raw/project_logs/evaluation_plan.md", "title": "evaluation_plan", "text": "# Evaluation 计划日志\n\n评测集计划包含四类 Query：单来源、多来源、语义改写和不可回答，并划分 dev 与冻结 test。系统 prediction 必须由真实 Router 和 Retriever 运行产生。\n\nKeyword baseline 记录 Router Accuracy、Recall@3、Recall@5、MRR 和 P50/P95 延迟，失败 case 不得删除。", "metadata": {"source_type": "project_logs", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_repository", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "evaluation_plan.md", "char_count": 200}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "project_logs-generation_validation_iteration-0-9b9bcb2dede3", "source_type": "project_logs", "source_path": "data/raw/project_logs/generation_validation_iteration.md", "title": "generation_validation_iteration", "text": "# Generation 与 Validation 迭代日志\n\nGenerator 通过 LlmClient Protocol 注入 Fake 或真实模型 adapter，要求模型输出 answer、cited chunk ids、sufficient 和 reason。\n\n模型 JSON 先做结构解析，再由 Citation Validator 检查引用。非法 JSON 和非法 citation 会转成不同的受控错误，不允许直接返回 answered。", "metadata": {"source_type": "project_logs", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_repository", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "generation_validation_iteration.md", "char_count": 229}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "project_logs-ingestion_iteration-0-b7d9b7f28891", "source_type": "project_logs", "source_path": "data/raw/project_logs/ingestion_iteration.md", "title": "ingestion_iteration", "text": "# Ingestion 模块迭代日志\n\n项目将本地 Markdown 和文本文件统一转换为 Document，再按空行和最大字符数生成 Chunk。Chunk 完整继承文档 metadata，并使用来源、路径、索引和文本生成稳定 ID。\n\n岗位数据额外支持 JSON/CSV importer，但采集爬虫不属于核心依赖。", "metadata": {"source_type": "project_logs", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_repository", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "ingestion_iteration.md", "char_count": 160}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "project_logs-retrieval_baseline-0-25f85eee4c6e", "source_type": "project_logs", "source_path": "data/raw/project_logs/retrieval_baseline.md", "title": "retrieval_baseline", "text": "# Keyword Retrieval Baseline 日志\n\n第一版 Retriever 不引入中文分词依赖。英文和数字按连续字符串提取，中文按单字和相邻双字生成 token，再使用 Query token 重叠率评分。\n\n检索支持 source type 过滤和 top-k，返回 score、rank、chunk id 与命中 token。该分数不是语义相似度。", "metadata": {"source_type": "project_logs", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_repository", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "retrieval_baseline.md", "char_count": 185}}
