{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "resume-education_availability-0-156d4c635945", "source_type": "resume", "source_path": "data/raw/resume/education_availability.md", "title": "education_availability", "text": "# 教育与实习时间候选记录\n\n候选人当前以实习求职和项目准备为主要目标，可以围绕具体岗位调整学习内容。可实习时间、到岗日期和每周出勤天数尚未由本人确认，正式投递前必须补充。\n\n该记录不能作为满足某个岗位出勤要求的证据，只能提醒系统指出信息缺失。", "metadata": {"source_type": "resume", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "education_availability.md", "char_count": 122}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "resume-gaps_and_learning-0-0e45949ca76b", "source_type": "resume", "source_path": "data/raw/resume/gaps_and_learning.md", "title": "gaps_and_learning", "text": "# 能力缺口与学习记录\n\n候选人的当前优势是 Python 基础、模块化实现、文档和测试意识。需要继续补充 SQL、FastAPI 服务化、Docker、embedding 检索和真实评测集建设。\n\n学习计划优先围绕可运行代码、失败样例和指标报告推进，不以堆叠 LangChain、LangGraph 等框架名称为目标。", "metadata": {"source_type": "resume", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "gaps_and_learning.md", "char_count": 160}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "resume-rag_project_experience-0-45abba9c3117", "source_type": "resume", "source_path": "data/raw/resume/rag_project_experience.md", "title": "rag_project_experience", "text": "# RAG 项目经历候选记录\n\n候选人设计了多源 Document 与 Chunk Schema，支持岗位、简历、面试笔记、项目日志和用户画像。系统包含规则 Router、关键词 Retriever、预算感知 Context Builder 和 Citation Validator。\n\n项目使用 JSONL Trace 保存路由、召回、生成、校验与耗时，并使用 Fake LLM 完成离线集成测试。", "metadata": {"source_type": "resume", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_repository", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "rag_project_experience.md", "char_count": 200}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "resume-sample_resume-0-6fcdc7dba4d7", "source_type": "resume", "source_path": "data/raw/resume/sample_resume.md", "title": "sample_resume", "text": "# 示例简历\n\n## 基本信息\n\n候选人：示例同学\n\n目标岗位：大模型应用研发实习生、AI 应用开发实习生、后端研发实习生。\n\n## 技能\n\n1. 熟悉 Python，能够编写基础数据处理脚本和单元测试。\n2. 了解 RAG（检索增强生成）、embedding（文本向量表示）、向量检索和 Agent 工具调用的基本概念。\n3. 熟悉 Git、Linux 基础命令，能够维护项目文档和开发日志。\n\n## 项目经历\n\n### 面向实习求职场景的多源 RAG/Agent 系统\n\n1. 设计岗位 JD、个人简历、八股面经、项目日志和用户画像等多源知识库。\n2. 实现本地文档读取、chunk 切分和 metadata 继承，为后续检索和引用做准备。\n3. 规划 Recall@k、引用准确率、Router Accuracy 等评测指标，用失败样例驱动迭代。", "metadata": {"source_type": "resume", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "sample_resume.md", "char_count": 376}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "resume-skill_matrix-0-8faeca0c9be2", "source_type": "resume", "source_path": "data/raw/resume/skill_matrix.md", "title": "skill_matrix", "text": "# 技能矩阵候选记录\n\n候选人能够使用 Python 编写脚本和单元测试，熟悉 Git 基础操作与 Linux 常用命令。对 FastAPI、SQL 和 Docker 有概念性了解，但缺少完整服务部署经历。\n\n在大模型方向，候选人理解 RAG、Chunk、关键词检索、Citation 和 Agent Trace，尚未完成 Dense Retrieval 与真实大模型评测。", "metadata": {"source_type": "resume", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "skill_matrix.md", "char_count": 187}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "user_profile-application_constraints-0-fcc750e3e522", "source_type": "user_profile", "source_path": "data/raw/user_profile/application_constraints.md", "title": "application_constraints", "text": "# 投递约束候选记录\n\n简历中的项目数字必须能够定位到测试或评测报告，目标值不能写成实测值。尚未运行真实模型、冻结 test 或部署服务时，不使用完成时描述这些能力。\n\n岗位信息可能下架或更新，投递前需要重新确认状态、城市、实习时间和来源页面。", "metadata": {"source_type": "user_profile", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "application_constraints.md", "char_count": 122}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "user_profile-interview_preferences-0-a7f982ab0547", "source_type": "user_profile", "source_path": "data/raw/user_profile/interview_preferences.md", "title": "interview_preferences", "text": "# 面试准备偏好候选记录\n\n项目讲解优先从问题、架构、数据流和指标开始，再说明技术实现。遇到没有做过的功能应直接说明限制和下一步验证方案。\n\n复习重点包括 RAG 切分、检索指标、Router、Context Budget、Citation Validator、Trace 和失败驱动回归。", "metadata": {"source_type": "user_profile", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "interview_preferences.md", "char_count": 145}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "user_profile-learning_plan-0-1410e644f4d2", "source_type": "user_profile", "source_path": "data/raw/user_profile/learning_plan.md", "title": "learning_plan", "text": "# 学习计划候选记录\n\n近期先完成固定语料、评测集和 Keyword baseline，再实现 Dense 与 Hybrid 检索对照。随后补充证据门控、回归测试和最小服务接口。\n\n学习每个模块时需要掌握输入输出、核心函数、失败排查、指标边界和面试追问，不只追求代码数量。", "metadata": {"source_type": "user_profile", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "learning_plan.md", "char_count": 136}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "user_profile-location_and_schedule-0-b3b142fb2c46", "source_type": "user_profile", "source_path": "data/raw/user_profile/location_and_schedule.md", "title": "location_and_schedule", "text": "# 地点与时间偏好候选记录\n\n候选城市优先考虑广州和深圳，也关注上海、杭州的合适岗位。是否接受长期异地和远程实习需要根据团队要求进一步确认。\n\n每周可实习天数、连续实习月份和最早到岗时间尚未完成本人核验，系统遇到相关问题时应明确说明信息缺失。", "metadata": {"source_type": "user_profile", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "location_and_schedule.md", "char_count": 121}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "user_profile-profile-0-70751fced17f", "source_type": "user_profile", "source_path": "data/raw/user_profile/profile.md", "title": "profile", "text": "# 用户画像\n\n## 求职目标\n\n1. 目标岗位：大模型应用研发实习生、AI 应用开发实习生、后端研发实习生。\n2. 目标地区：广州、深圳、上海、杭州，也接受远程实习。\n3. 希望项目能体现工程能力、测试意识、可观测性和效果评测能力。\n\n## 当前准备重点\n\n1. 构建一个面向实习求职场景的多源 RAG/Agent 系统。\n2. 准备每个模块的面试讲解，包括输入、输出、核心函数和失败排查。\n3. 避免过早复杂化，先完成最小可运行版本，再做 LangGraph 或 LlamaIndex 重构。\n\n## 偏好\n\n1. 回答要尽量结合岗位 JD 和个人简历。\n2. 当证据不足时，系统应该说明不确定，而不是编造经历。\n3. 评测结果必须来自真实测试或人工标注，不能伪造。", "metadata": {"source_type": "user_profile", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "profile.md", "char_count": 335}}
{"dataset_version": "evalrag_v0.1", "chunk_id": "user_profile-role_priority-0-5aee6997af02", "source_type": "user_profile", "source_path": "data/raw/user_profile/role_priority.md", "title": "role_priority", "text": "# 岗位优先级候选记录\n\n第一优先级是大模型应用研发和 RAG 工程相关实习，第二优先级是 AI 平台或 Python 后端岗位。岗位最好能接触真实数据、效果评测和工程交付。\n\n不把纯爬虫、无评测的聊天 Demo 或只堆框架名称的项目作为主要投递优势。", "metadata": {"source_type": "user_profile", "job_id": "", "company": "unknown", "job_title": "unknown", "city": "unknown", "source_platform": "project_authored", "source_url": "unknown", "first_seen_at": "", "last_seen_at": "", "status": "unknown", "version": 1, "source_priority": 0, "content_hash": "", "chunk_index": 0, "source_file_name": "role_priority.md", "char_count": 126}}
